      "title": "He, she, we, they",
      "explanation": [
        "| | one person | more than one |\n|---|---|---|\n| I / we | **ek** | **ons** |\n| you | **jy** | **julle** |\n| he / she / they | **hy**, **sy** | **hulle** |",
        "Still just **is** for everyone: **Hulle is siek.** = They are sick."
      ],
      "examples": [
